===Etymology===
{{dercat|enm|gmw-pro|inh=1}}
From {{inh|enm|ang|frīġedæġ}}. Forms with ''-e-'' are possibly after {{cog|non|freadagr}}, {{m|non|frjádagr}}, but may also represent the regular phonological development of {{m|ang|frīġedæġ}} in some dialects.

